      "BETTY: Yes, I understand. I'll get back to you.\nCLAUDE: Good morning - Something wrong? You said to come in today, remember? You said you may have a book for m e to edit. Is it a bad time? Have I …\nBETTY: No, no, it's the right day and it's absolutely the perfect time. In fact, the timing is quite extraordinary. Do you believe in fate?\nCLAUDE: I'm sorry?",
      "CELESTE: I'll sing it -\nSYLVIE: Not now, Celeste -\nCELESTE: 'The Kangaroo escaped the Zoo. \"Goodbye zoo!\" cried Kangaroo, Cleared the wall with one clean jump, Leaped across with a great big thump - '",
      "CELESTE: Do you like it?\nSYLVIE: E-T- T. E - E.E-T-A-0-I-N-U-S-H-R- R.E-T-A-0-I-N-U-S-H-R- Terrific? You want m e to pin it up? I'll put it next to Theo's Mickey Mouse -\nSYLVIE: Say goodbye -\nCELESTE: Bye -"
    ]
